# /products/ and sitemap.xml ARE committed on purpose.
#
# They're generated by scripts/build.js, which Vercel runs on every
# deploy — so they're normally regenerated and these copies are just
# refreshed. They're tracked anyway as a safety net: if the build ever
# fails to run, the committed copies keep every shop link working
# instead of 404ing. Once the Vercel build is confirmed green you can
# ignore them again if the diff noise is annoying.

.DS_Store
node_modules/
.vercel
